sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server

    Note right of browser: User writes a new note in the input field
    Note right of browser: User clicks the "Save" button

    Note right of browser: JavaScript intercepts the form submit\n(prevents page reload)

    browser->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/new_note_spa
    activate server
    Note left of server: Server saves the new note
    server-->>browser: JSON response (confirmation / updated note)
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: Browser updates the notes list\nusing JavaScript (DOM manipulation)
    Note right of browser: Page is NOT reloaded
